  "description": "TOLQOE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C168 H175 Dy14 N7 O91,31(H2 O1),24(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy9 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy10 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy11 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy12 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy13 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy14 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.608-4.078 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.30-119.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy14(HL3)7(OAc)28]·24CH3CN·31H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 28 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
